Portrait of a fantasy D&D character. A massive, muscular human man in his 40s. Arms always bare — sleeveless leather vest. Anchor tattoo on his right bicep. Rough, weathered face, short dark hair, stubble. Holding a knife casually in one hand (not threatening — like he uses it for everything). Mediterranean look, dockworker build. Background: dimly lit warehouse with wooden crates. Style: realistic fantasy portrait, warm lighting, waist-up.
